    "id": "p9-q13-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "13",
    "prompt": "Ed eats $\\frac{1}{9}$ of a cake. Flo eats $\\frac{4}{9}$ of the same cake. What fraction of the cake is left?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{4}{9}$",
      "worked": "Fraction eaten:\n$$\\frac{1}{9}+\\frac{4}{9}=\\frac{5}{9}.$$\nFraction left:\n$$\\begin{align*}1-\\frac{5}{9}&=\\frac{9}{9}-\\frac{5}{9}\\\\1-\\frac{5}{9}&=\\frac{4}{9}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
